      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I hadn't seen or spoken to my brother in nearly a month. My texts, calls, emails, had largely gone unanswered unless it ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 264
        }
      ],
      "words": 28
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But despite how happy I was, I couldn't help but think of my brother and the fact that my happiness was causing him pain",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2149
        }
      ],
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"I can't—\" He let out a shaky breath, still unwilling to meet my eyes. \"I'm sorry. I can't do this.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4179
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"we could alternate who hosts each week. And we could invite different people to cohost.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5759
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"Yeah. Whatever.\" He was totally detached, and his ability to ice me out so completely stung",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7929
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It had been two months since Levi and I had attempted—and failed—to record the first episode",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9974
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Two things can be true at once. I smiled, thinking of my mom",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11151
        }
      ],
      "words": 13
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"Hi, Derek,\" she whispered",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11670
        }
      ],
      "words": 4
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"Carson has evolved. You have evolved, and Levi is still hung up on the past.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14958
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "it feels like Levi needs to put in some work of his own instead of blaming everyone else",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15679
        }
      ],
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"The two can coexist, even as impossible as it seems.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13867
        }
      ],
      "words": 10
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"Punishing yourself doesn't accomplish anything, believe me.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14138
        }
      ],
      "words": 7
    },
    {
      "block": "原句13",
      "no": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "For my favorite person.\" He set it on the coffee table along with some plates and forks",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17340
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句14",
      "no": 14,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I thought maybe it could be our tradition, one we start—together",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17428
        }
      ],
      "words": 11
    },
    {
      "block": "原句15",
      "no": 15,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "No matter what happened, I could never regret loving him",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17761
        }
      ],
      "words": 10
    }
  ],
